{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id224530460"}, "name":{"label":"jengami"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-31T05:29:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.420"}, "id":{"label":"14733478724"}, "title":{"label":"Works great, easy to use, pleasant wake up"}, "content":{"label":"Great app. I love seeing how long it takes for me to fall asleep, how much sleep I get, what time(s) I get up in the middle of the night. It’s great to see the sleep quality and analysis over time too thanks to its tracking. The easing into the wake-up based on when you’re farthest from deep REM as possible is wonderful too. Highly recommend!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id28592773"}, "name":{"label":"m.fdskfgjkldf;v;lfk"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-30T21:58:33-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.420"}, "id":{"label":"14732329811"}, "title":{"label":"Really great app"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve never had trouble sleeping, but I mostly just use this as my alarm. I like how you can have it wake you up over a 30 minute period to “ease” you awake. The regular iPhone alarm clock doesn’t do that. I also enjoy Elsa doing the “wind down” exercises. Her voice is so soothing. 😊😴", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id27097791"}, "name":{"label":"Skiterbolt"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-30T04:55:32-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.420"}, "id":{"label":"14729308335"}, "title":{"label":"I’ve use this app for years"}, "content":{"label":"This app has worked well in tracking my sleep, sleep habits, and routine. As and alarm in the morning it has worked flawlessly.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id49232703"}, "name":{"label":"jaymoLOVESps"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-29T22:34:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.420"}, "id":{"label":"14728370930"}, "title":{"label":"Long time user!"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using this app for literally 10 years now, and i still love it! they’ve added a bunch of features over time, many of which i haven’t tried out yet. But overall it works great for slowly waking me up as a first alarm before my actual alarm goes off (i set 4-5 alarms lol, but this one i set to go off first as a more gentle way to wake up). I also barely write reviews but i figured i should write something being a 10 year customer!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id135707139"}, "name":{"label":"موهيمن"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-29T09:57:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.420"}, "id":{"label":"14726401822"}, "title":{"label":"A trusted sleep companion for more than 15 years"}, "content":{"label":"I’ve been using Sleep Cycle since around 2010, just a year after it launched, and it’s been part of my routine for a long time. I especially appreciate how it turns each night into information I can use: sleep duration and quality estimates, long-term statistics, and notes that help me look for connections between my habits and my rest. The smart alarm and nighttime sound tracking add even more value.\n\nI also appreciate that Sleep Cycle’s data has contributed to published research exploring sleep patterns on a much larger scale. I use the app’s scores as a way to follow trends and learn about my routine, not as a medical diagnosis.\n\nRecently, I contacted customer service and told them how much I enjoyed the app years ago, when I could use the premium features for free. They listened and were happy to help me get things working the way I remembered. That thoughtful support meant a lot to me as a longtime user.\n\nSleep Cycle has continued to evolve, and I’m glad to be using it again. It’s a helpful app backed by a team that treats its customers with care.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
