{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id107164701"}, "name":{"label":"Oorf oorf"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-24T02:39:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.410"}, "id":{"label":"14704720880"}, "title":{"label":"Great"}, "content":{"label":"Fantastic app. Recommended it to a professor after just two days. \n\nBeen using it for nearly a decade and a half since. Ensures I feel well-rested when I wake up. The few times a year I use a regular alarm I can feel the difference in the morning.\n\nEvery couple years update this review. I really hope they keep supporting this amazing app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
