{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id1565501825"}, "name":{"label":"Idk so sure good stuff"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-20T21:02:34-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.410"}, "id":{"label":"14691831529"}, "title":{"label":"Good at tracking sleep"}, "content":{"label":"I was looking for an app that could tell me when I fell asleep, how long I slept, and how was my sleep. And this app is exactly that. You don’t need to pay for premium to to have it track and set alarms so I find it just what I need without having to pay for a subscription. The problem is it helps me wake up but as soon as I turn it off I go right back to bed so if there was a way to die that, great", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id346263913"}, "name":{"label":"valeriyankaa"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-20T20:21:26-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.410"}, "id":{"label":"14691739787"}, "title":{"label":"bring free version back"}, "content":{"label":"i don’t usually leave reviews but i feel ticked off enough to leave one for this app, mostly because it was somehow force deleted from my phone sometime in the last couple of days without my knowledge or consent, and upon redownloading it, now has a paywall. i have been using this app on and off since 2016 and to my knowledge there has always been a free version with less sleep insights and features but that didn’t bother me much because i don’t care to listen to my sleep talking or snoring or review in depth sleep analytics, etc. what gives, yo? consider bringing back a free or “lite”version for $5 with just basic features- one or two alarm sounds and ability to view sleep and waking time for people who can’t dish out $60 for an app", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
