{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id125231017"}, "name":{"label":"Prvegapr"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-17T09:58:16-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"3"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.400"}, "id":{"label":"14678270647"}, "title":{"label":"It was Great but Goodbye"}, "content":{"label":"I used sleep cycle for many years and it was great. I had to say goodbye sadly because of some synchronization issues. It suddenly started to synchronize the day before as the day of sleep. Tried everything recommended online and AI recommendations to fix the issue and now I cant log back into my account. Even with premium subscription it seems to not recognize my email even though I get my subscription receipt on that email. I lost all my sleep logs so sadly saying goodbye. Its a great app with great features and super accurate readings but it shouldn’t be complicated to log in back to your account when you have synch issues. 3 stars for the years it worked correctly \n🙏🏼💙😴🛌", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id192523775"}, "name":{"label":"Victoria Chudo"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-17T05:29:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.400"}, "id":{"label":"14677296820"}, "title":{"label":"Love it"}, "content":{"label":"Love it", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id291709241"}, "name":{"label":"Mr. Cookie."}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-17T02:54:39-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.400"}, "id":{"label":"14676843302"}, "title":{"label":"Solid."}, "content":{"label":"Been using this app faithfully since 2015 as my main alarm clock. Its now late 2026. \n\nNow, the alarm doesn’t always wake me up, but short of having something which would glue me to the ceiling and anger my household, it works, very well. \n\nThe program has gotten much better at correctly detecting sleep or awake over the years. If i’m lying in bed watching something not moving it might think i’m asleep tho.  It doesn’t forget music selections nearly as often anymore. \n\nIt has a pretty solid companion app for the apple watch. \n\n\nNow for my gripes. \n\nIf you accidentally close the app, session over, maybe it saved it maybe it didn’t :(. \n\nPLEASE PLEASE make the apple watch vibrate ALONGSIDE the alarm not a one or the other, vibrate only or alarm. \n\nIts TOO EASY to snooze and stay snoozed and then simply TURN OFF.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
