{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id18968944"}, "name":{"label":"itsmekeir"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-14T19:50:05-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.400"}, "id":{"label":"14667908962"}, "title":{"label":"Life changing"}, "content":{"label":"I have been using sleep cycle almost nightly since summer of 2018, I was the type of person who was extremely difficult to wake up, always groggy, frustrating for my loved ones, often late to work/ school because waking up was so hard. A friend of mine at a bachelorette weekend actually recommended Sleep Cycle to me. She told me that it listens to you sleep and wakes you up when you’re already most awake (not in REM) so it’s much easier to get up, so I tried it and have never looked back. I’m telling you, I should buy stock in this company because I tell so many people about it. This app genuinely changed my life and I don’t know what I would do without it.. THANK YOU SLEEP CYCLE! (I don’t even know if there is a free version, but I do subscribe to it and it is worth every freaking penny)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
