{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id30119460"}, "name":{"label":"NC-Fisher"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-12T19:39:48-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.400"}, "id":{"label":"14660117823"}, "title":{"label":"Elsa and the Snoring Symphony"}, "content":{"label":"I enjoy the sleep aids, especially the deep breathing guides and audio tracks. I’m not sure how accurate the tracking is - in many cases it has tracked my dogs’ movements and breathing but the audio recordings are hilarious. Elsa - my sleep coach - is super cool and I’m often asleep before the guide is through. It pairs well with Apple health and I enjoy the wake up window feature.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id164710658"}, "name":{"label":"K Show"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-12T05:43:41-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.391"}, "id":{"label":"14657639179"}, "title":{"label":"Completely Inaccurate"}, "content":{"label":"I’m being awakened many times a night due to hot flashes and wanted to track the frequency - I used a hand written log on several nights in addition to the app and the app was so far off as to show I was in deep sleep or REM when I was fully awake. Therefore can’t trust a thing - the data looks cool and is displayed with authority but if it’s not accurate what’s the point", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
