{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id327307132"}, "name":{"label":"Dorothybetty"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2026-10-06T09:55:29-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"6.26.391"}, "id":{"label":"14635062139"}, "title":{"label":"Almost useless with current problems"}, "content":{"label":"I've been using this app since 2013, but over the last five years or so, it has gradually become useless. During the night, it loses access to the microphone, and during that time, you can't tell if you were sleeping or what is happening there's some sort of problem-solving if you go to the app in the App Store, but it's completely inadequate. I'm not using my phone for anything in the middle of the night, so there's no reason for it to be losing function. I'm obviously going to have to find a new sleep app that works. Because this one does not. It also used to show me my snoring, but now it won't show me my snoring because they made that a premium feature.  I think when apps take things that initially came with the app and then make them cost extra that is poor behavior on the part of the manufacturer. It's bait and switch at the very least. If you have an iPhone, there's no point in using this app.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=320606217&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-11-23T23:54:37-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
